[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=政务工作记录台
GenericName=工作记录与荣誉档案
Comment=本机离线使用的工作记录、进展与荣誉档案管理
Exec=@@BIN@@/civic-work-desk
Icon=@@PREFIX@@/current/app/icons/icon-512.png
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=false
Categories=Office;ProjectManagement;
Keywords=工作记录;台账;荣誉;报表;CivicWorkDesk;
# @@BIN@@ and @@PREFIX@@ are substituted by install.sh with absolute paths. The installer refuses to
# finish if any placeholder survives, because a desktop entry with an unresolved Exec fails silently
# from the menu — the user clicks and nothing happens at all.
#
# Exec is an absolute path on purpose: a desktop session does not necessarily have ~/.local/bin on
# PATH, and there is no working directory to depend on.
#
# The browser is not named here. The launcher goes through xdg-open, i.e. the desktop's own default
# association, which on the tested target is com.360.browser-stable.desktop. Naming the 360 binary
# directly would risk starting it with a different profile, and the business data belongs to a
# profile, so that would look like an empty application.
